  {
    "id": "0b247917-5009-4968-a017-d2e937b1909f",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 37.6,
    "endS": 57.4,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I feel like what I always saw or referenced were these, like, big, hearty old school books that never really talked about color had super fun things to do in them. Um, very like old school pottery.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c2d6dc25-7750-4456-bb6b-3b722551cd62",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 86.9,
    "endS": 98,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I hope the book provides to its readers at, um, like a good reference for just general, um, clay knowledge.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a2d3e189-a4dc-46b6-b4d0-e4d37405be9f",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 98,
    "endS": 107.6,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "But also, I really want people to be creative and be kind to themselves.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b749955d-3955-4694-8434-0b4e6c80fdc5",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 119.8,
    "endS": 130.5,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that there's a pressure to produce things. As a creative person, but not to be kind of kind to yourself about what the process is going to be like,",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "5b8b7066-6083-48bc-bc81-3b6a534591ed",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 133.5,
    "endS": 147.2,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "When you're kind to yourself, you are rolling with the punches. You are more open to be flexible with your designs, and you can end up with something that turns out way better than your original design.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bada7d3c-e9e4-40be-8559-c336b6966766",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 501.6,
    "endS": 521.3,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "And then you're like, well, what if this looked slightly different? Or what if this, instead of a tulip was a daffodil? And let's try to achieve that. So it's kind of like sitting at the wheel and just like letting yourself adjust, grow whatever ideas and just see if they're achievable.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T14:51:13.047Z"
  },
